* TBIL1 -- Traffic billing screen
MAP TBIL1 SIZE 24x80
  FIELD HEADER    AT 0,2   LEN 40 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD USERID    AT 0,70  LEN 8  PROT DIM    COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD OPENCNT   AT 5,30  LEN 5  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD OPENTOTAL AT 6,30  LEN 14 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD MESSAGE   AT 10,5  LEN 60 PROT DIM    COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD FOOTER    AT 23,2  LEN 60 PROT DIM    COLOR=BLUE
ENDMAP
